@startuml
title Вариант A — основной сценарий доставки через push
autonumber

actor "Банковский сервис" as Source
participant "Notification API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Debezium" as CDC
queue "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Delivery Orchestrator" as Orchestrator
participant "Preference Adapter" as Pref
participant "Template Service" as Template
participant "Push Worker" as Worker
participant "Push Provider" as Provider
participant "Мобильное приложение" as App
participant "Callback Gateway" as Callback

Source -> API: POST notification + idempotency_key
API -> DB: BEGIN
API -> DB: INSERT notification(ACCEPTED)
API -> DB: INSERT outbox(NotificationAccepted)
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Source: 202 Accepted + notification_id

CDC -> DB: читает committed WAL
CDC -> Kafka: NotificationAccepted
Kafka -> Orchestrator: событие (at-least-once)
Orchestrator -> DB: Inbox dedup + lock/version check
Orchestrator -> Pref: настройки и валидные контакты
Pref --> Orchestrator: push разрешён, token актуален
Orchestrator -> Template: render(template, locale, payload)
Template --> Orchestrator: push content
Orchestrator -> DB: PLANNED -> PUSH_IN_PROGRESS + Outbox PushCommand
CDC -> Kafka: PushCommand

Kafka -> Worker: PushCommand
Worker -> DB: Inbox dedup + INSERT unique attempt
Worker -> Provider: send(idempotency_key, token, content)
Provider --> Worker: accepted + provider_message_id
Worker -> DB: attempt = PROVIDER_ACCEPTED + outbox
CDC -> Kafka: PushAccepted
Provider -> App: push
App -> Callback: app acknowledgement(notification_id)
Callback -> DB: сохранить callback + outbox
CDC -> Kafka: DeliveryConfirmed
Kafka -> Orchestrator: DeliveryConfirmed
Orchestrator -> DB: conditional update -> DELIVERED

Source -> API: GET /notifications/{id}
API -> DB: read status
API --> Source: DELIVERED via PUSH

note over API,DB
Ответ 202 даётся только после commit.
Повтор idempotency_key возвращает тот же ID.
end note

note over Worker,Orchestrator
Inbox, unique attempt и versioned transition
делают повтор Kafka-события безопасным.
end note
@enduml
